#: includes/class-abilities.php:85
msgid "Read-only site analytics: traffic, pages, referrers, geography, devices, and events."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:100
msgid "Get traffic totals"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:101
msgid "Total pageviews, unique visitors, average daily pageviews, average time on page and bounce rate for a date range (defaults to the last 30 days). Time on page is active time (the tab in front of the reader, at most 30 minutes a view), averaged over the views that reported one. Bounce rate is the percentage of visitors who viewed exactly one page in a day. Both are null until there is data for the range."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:122
msgid "Get daily traffic series"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:123
msgid "Per-day pageviews and visitors over a date range, for charting trends."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:132
msgid "Get top pages"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:133
msgid "Most-viewed pages for a date range, ranked by pageviews, with each page's average active time on page in seconds (null when no view of it reported a time)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:142
msgid "Get top referrers"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:143
msgid "Top referring sites sending traffic for a date range."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:152
msgid "Get traffic by country"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:153
msgid "Visitor counts broken down by country for a date range."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:162
msgid "Get device breakdown"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:163
msgid "Visitor breakdown by browser, operating system, and device type for a date range."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:172
msgid "Get custom events"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:173
msgid "Top custom events for a date range. Pass a `name` to break a single event down by value."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:179
msgid "Optional event name to break down by value."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:189
msgid "Get stats for a post"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:190
msgid "Lifetime and date-range pageviews/visitors, a daily series, and the top referrers for a single post or page. Use get-top-pages first if you only have a title or path."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:196
msgid "The post or page ID to report on."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:207
msgid "Get hourly traffic series"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:208
msgid "Pageviews and visitors per hour, for \"what time of day do people visit\" and for looking at today or yesterday in detail. Covers at most two days; longer ranges are cut to the last two days. Defaults to today."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:217
msgid "Get what changed"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:218
msgid "What changed against the previous period of the same length: a one-sentence summary, the pages and traffic sources that gained or lost the most, shifts in the traffic mix, and health warnings such as tracking having stopped or a 404 spike. Call this first when asked \"how is the site doing\" or \"why is traffic up/down\"."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:227
msgid "Get weekly highlights"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:228
msgid "Short, ready-to-quote highlights for a finished week: milestones crossed, the biggest gaining page, a new referrer, the best day. Defaults to the last seven full days. Returns an empty list when nothing stood out."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:237
msgid "Get traffic by channel"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:238
msgid "Pageviews and visitors grouped by how people arrived: direct, search engines, AI assistants, social networks, and other referring sites, with each channel's share. Use get-top-referrers for the individual sites inside a channel."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:247
msgid "Get stats for one referrer"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:248
msgid "Everything about traffic from one referring site: pageviews and visitors in the range, a daily series, and which of your pages it sent people to. Pass the host as shown by get-top-referrers, for example \"news.ycombinator.com\"."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:254
msgid "The referring site, as a hostname or URL."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:265
msgid "Get AI assistant traffic"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:266
msgid "What AI assistants take and what they send back: requests made by AI crawlers (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot and others) against readers (visitors) that ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini and the rest referred to the site, per assistant, with the ratio of crawler requests per reader sent. Everything covers the days crawlers were counted; when that starts later than the requested range, `since` holds that date."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:275
msgid "Get Google Search Console data"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:276
msgid "Google Search performance synced from Search Console: site-wide clicks, impressions, CTR and average position plus the top search queries, or, when post_id or path is given, the queries that brought people to that one page. Returns connected=false with no data when Search Console is not connected under Settings. Google's data lags two to three days behind."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:282
msgid "Optional post or page ID to get the queries for that page only."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:286
msgid "Optional page path (for example /pricing) instead of post_id."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:296
msgid "Get stats for one event"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:297
msgid "One custom event in depth: total and unique counts, a daily series, how many distinct values it carried, and the top values. Use get-events to find event names first."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:303
msgid "The event name, as listed by get-events."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:314
msgid "Get missing pages (404s)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:315
msgid "Paths that returned 404, ranked by hits. Split into broken links (reached from one of your own pages, with the page that links there, so they can be fixed) and probes (scanners and outside links). Use this for \"do I have broken links\" and for a 404 spike flagged by get-changes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:324
msgid "Get bot and crawler traffic"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:325
msgid "Requests the bot filter rejected, per category (search engines, AI crawlers, SEO tools, monitors, scrapers and so on), with the share of all requests they made up. None of these are in the pageview totals; use this when numbers look lower than another tool's, or when asked how much AI crawlers read the site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:334
msgid "Get Core Web Vitals"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:335
msgid "Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) measured on real visitors, reported at the 75th percentile the way Google grades them, each with a good/needs-improvement/poor rating and the sample count. Empty when no measurements were recorded in the range."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:344
msgid "Get chart notes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:345
msgid "Notes the site owner pinned to dates on the traffic chart, such as \"newsletter sent\" or \"redesign launched\". Check these when explaining a spike or a dip, since they often hold the reason."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:354
msgid "Get year in review"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:355
msgid "The year in review for one calendar year: totals against the year before, the busiest month and day, the top pages, posts published that year, top referrers, countries, and AI crawler activity. Includes imported history from a previous analytics tool. Defaults to the current year."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:361
msgid "The calendar year to report on. Defaults to the current year."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:372
msgid "Get goal completions (Pro)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:373
msgid "Conversion goals with completion counts and total value for a date range. Requires Vireo Analytics Pro."
msgstr ""

